1
00:00:00,221 --> 00:00:02,191
(line ringing)

2
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,390
STUART:
This is Debbie!

3
00:00:03,391 --> 00:00:04,691
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
And this is Stuart!

4
00:00:04,692 --> 00:00:08,292
BOTH:
Just kidding!

5
00:00:08,296 --> 00:00:11,226
STUART:
Leave a message!

6
00:00:11,232 --> 00:00:13,302
(beeps)

7
00:00:14,602 --> 00:00:17,572
(whispers):
This is the part where you talk.

8
00:00:20,141 --> 00:00:22,171
(Dan:)All right, let's say
a physician was prescribing

9
00:00:22,176 --> 00:00:24,706
(Dan:)one of our competitor's drugs.

10
00:00:24,712 --> 00:00:26,542
(Dan:)How would you convince them
to switch to ours?

11
00:00:31,319 --> 00:00:33,519
(Sheldon:)Um...

12
00:00:33,521 --> 00:00:35,351
(Penny:)any chance his car needs

13
00:00:35,356 --> 00:00:38,496
(Penny:)to be washed by a girl
in a bikini?

14
00:00:39,327 --> 00:00:41,697
(quietly):
No...

15
00:00:41,696 --> 00:00:43,966
(Penny:)Okay, I'm really sorry
for wasting your time.

16
00:00:43,965 --> 00:00:46,535
(Dan:)Don't worry about it.
Thanks for stopping by.

17
00:00:46,534 --> 00:00:48,604
(Penny:)Okay, thanks.

18
00:00:50,171 --> 00:00:53,041
(Penny:)Um, I'm sor...
Listen, could you do me a favor

19
00:00:53,041 --> 00:00:55,911
(Penny:)and not tell Bernadette
how badly I blew this interview?

20
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,310
(Penny:)She'll get upset.

21
00:00:57,312 --> 00:01:01,082
(Penny:)And honestly I'm a...
a little terrified of her.

